    "name": "Space Cat Solitaire",
    "steam_appid": 3175050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Cat Solitaire is a puzzle card game adventure set in a euphoric 80s-inspired retro-future. With cats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/c175d198b46aeae850d30e6aebad1332.poster.avif?t=1755340138\" width=616 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/c175d198b46aeae850d30e6aebad1332.webm?t=1755340138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/c175d198b46aeae850d30e6aebad1332.mp4?t=1755340138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's solitaire reimagined! Space Cat Solitaire turns the classic solitaire formula on its head with three key ingredients: <u>Agency</u>, <u>Purpose</u>, and <u>Style</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Game of Skill, not Chance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most hands are winnable if you're clever enough! Whether you choose a walk-in-the-park or a devious challenge is completely up to you!  Unlimited undos give you the flexibility to retry any deal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/ac92f50b589481f2937951adb332b7d2.poster.avif?t=1755340138\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/ac92f50b589481f2937951adb332b7d2.webm?t=1755340138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/ac92f50b589481f2937951adb332b7d2.mp4?t=1755340138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Win Fabulous Prizes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rewarded for your work! Unlock trophies for completing special challenges, or spend your earnings on customizations for your very own space kitten! The most elite cadets will even be offered exciting story-driven missions for the zany denizens of the Whiskerfang Expanse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/df1c7ed3999d87165df2239265cee693.poster.avif?t=1755340138\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/df1c7ed3999d87165df2239265cee693.webm?t=1755340138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/df1c7ed3999d87165df2239265cee693.mp4?t=1755340138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy The Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the relaxing sights and sounds of reorganizing your cards, to the unleashing of a massive combo, to the fanfare of a victory, every moment is like basking in a warm sunbeam. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/c7044dae59e35425c3348dd7fd217ebb.poster.avif?t=1755340138\" width=616 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/c7044dae59e35425c3348dd7fd217ebb.webm?t=1755340138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/c7044dae59e35425c3348dd7fd217ebb.mp4?t=1755340138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Supernova of Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique &amp; refreshing variants of solitaire (this ain't your grandma's solitaire)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulties per variant for a wide range of players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modifier modes (&quot;purrallel universes&quot;) for even greater challenges and greater rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player stats &amp; charts to record your triumphs. Share (or brag) to your friends (and their cats)!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable trophies and cosmetics to customize your very own Space Kitten!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven missions: unique unlockable episodic challenges following Space Kitten's first big adventure in space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space. And cats. And solitaire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After decades of working soul-crushing number-crunching jobs for other people's creative visions, Gray Duck (a.k.a. Clive)  was born. Armed with nothing but a childhood dream and a severance check, Clive learned to code, learned Unity, Illustrator, Audacity, Photoshop, and more, all in the hopes of making his first game. Space Cat Solitaire is not his &quot;dream game,&quot; but it is a still a labor of love, and combines many of his passions, from Cats, to Space and, of course, solving puzzles. Clive is active on the Gray Duck Games Discord, where he invites you to share pictures of your cats while we're all waiting for the game to release. :)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Cat Solitaire is a puzzle card game adventure set in a euphoric 80s-inspired retro-future. With cats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/c175d198b46aeae850d30e6aebad1332.poster.avif?t=1755340138\" width=616 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/c175d198b46aeae850d30e6aebad1332.webm?t=1755340138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/c175d198b46aeae850d30e6aebad1332.mp4?t=1755340138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's solitaire reimagined! Space Cat Solitaire turns the classic solitaire formula on its head with three key ingredients: <u>Agency</u>, <u>Purpose</u>, and <u>Style</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Game of Skill, not Chance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most hands are winnable if you're clever enough! Whether you choose a walk-in-the-park or a devious challenge is completely up to you!  Unlimited undos give you the flexibility to retry any deal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/ac92f50b589481f2937951adb332b7d2.poster.avif?t=1755340138\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175050/extras/ac92f50b589481f2937951adb332b7d2.webm?t=1755340138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175